{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["License :: OSI Approved :: Apache Software License", "Programming Language :: Python"], "description": "Python Sdk\n===\n\u5b9e\u73b0\u5c01\u88c5\u4e00\u8a00API\u7684PythonSDK\uff0c\u652f\u6301AIStudio\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u8fdb\u884c\u57fa\u4e8e\u4e00\u8a00\u7684\u9879\u76ee/\u5e94\u7528/\u63d2\u4ef6\u5f00\u53d1\u9700\u6c42\n\u5b9e\u73b0\u5c01\u88c5AIStudio\u6a21\u578b\u5e93API\u7684PythonSDK\uff0c\u652f\u6301AIStudio\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u8fdb\u884c\u6a21\u578b\u5e93\u7684\u64cd\u4f5c\u5f00\u53d1\u9700\u6c42\n\n\u5feb\u901f\u5f00\u59cb\n---\n\u5982\u4f55\u6784\u5efa\u3001\u5b89\u88c5\u3001\u8fd0\u884c\n\n```bash\npip install aistudio-sdk --upgrade\n```\n\n\u6d4b\u8bd5\n---\n\u5982\u4f55\u6267\u884c\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u6d4b\u8bd5\n\n\u5982\u4f55\u8d21\u732e\n---\n\u8d21\u732epatch\u6d41\u7a0b\u53ca\u8d28\u91cf\u8981\u6c42\n\n\u7248\u672c\u4fe1\u606f\n---\n\u672c\u9879\u76ee\u7684\u5404\u7248\u672c\u4fe1\u606f\u548c\u53d8\u66f4\u5386\u53f2\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728[\u8fd9\u91cc][changelog]\u67e5\u770b\u3002\n\n\u7ef4\u62a4\u8005\n---\n### owners\n* xiangyiqing(xiangyiqing@baidu.com)\n\n### committers\n* xiangyiqing(xiangyiqing@baidu.com)\n* linyichong(linyichong@baidu.com)\n* suoyi(suoyi@baidu.com)\n\n\u8ba8\u8bba\n---\n\n\n\n[changelog]: http://\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["License-File"], "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "aistudio-sdk", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/aistudio-sdk/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/aistudio-sdk/", "project_urls": null, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/aistudio-sdk/0.3.9/", "requires_dist": ["psutil", "requests", "tqdm"